5,1,1,talk,George,,I’ve noticed the car is causing friction lately. I want to understand what actually sours groups like ours before we decide anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The friction is real. I want to see where the time actually goes before we commit to another year of this.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I care about the car being ready when I need it. I want to know what makes it feel reliable on a plain midweek morning.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’m curious what an even split really costs here. I want to see the actual figures before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know the real numbers. Who drives how much? I don't want to guess anymore.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"I’d like to look into what other car-sharing households said, and our own past attempts at checking figures.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I’ll look into the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I’ll check last year’s fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I’ll look into last year’s fuel receipts and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,Good. We have our tasks. Let’s see what the numbers and memories reveal before we argue further.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll review the diary hours and the recording trial. Let’s see if the effort matches the benefit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’ll check the handover state and the weekly trips. I need to know why mornings are so unpredictable for me.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I’ll review the fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers. I need to see the true cost of our shares.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll check the fuel receipts and the diary hours. I want to see who drives the most.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I’ll wait for the findings. Understanding the past will help us avoid repeating the same mistakes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll wait for the findings. Understanding the past will help us avoid repeating the same mistakes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
