35,2,1,talk,George,,- **George**: The other households said asking favours each time is what breaks trust. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The diary shows Saturday use is triple Tuesday’s. The recording trial cost an hour weekly. That administrative burden is the real cost.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Twice this year I found it with the fuel light on and rubbish inside. Plus, three of us have fixed weekly trips that keep collapsing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are over 280,000 yen. The fuel receipts show two people bought most of the fuel. An even split ignores this imbalance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found the fuel receipts are very uneven. Two people bought most of it. The diary shows Saturdays are busier than Tuesdays.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, that hour weekly is a heavy price. @Misaki, the uneven fuel costs are worrying. We must find a fair balance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the hour is just the start. The real cost is the evening spent untangling who owes what.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that administrative burden is exactly why my mornings feel so chaotic. I need a system that prevents the car from being left in a bad state.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the state of the car matters, but the money is the root. If we don't fix the split, the resentment will keep the car messy.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I agree. The uneven fuel costs are hard to ignore. I just want a way that feels fair to everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, fairness is vital, but remember our past. Checking figures made people feel accused. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. The checking spell was toxic. We need a system that runs without constant scrutiny or accusation.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, I hear you, but a clean car is a precondition for trust. If I can’t rely on the basics, the money split feels irrelevant.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I understand the frustration. But without clear financial boundaries, the resentment will only grow. We need to address the money first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@George, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to make anyone feel accused. I just want the numbers to be clear so we can all feel safe.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Minato, no apology needed. We all just want peace. Let’s focus on a system that protects our friendships, not just the car.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@George, agreed. We need a structure that minimizes the need for constant checking. The data shows the effort is too high for the current setup.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, I understand the money matters. But if the car is dirty or empty, I can’t use it at all. We need reliability before we can talk about fairness.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I hear you. But if the money stays murky, the resentment will keep the car messy. We need clear financial boundaries first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand. A clean car is important. But I also worry about the money. Can we find a way that helps both?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
