60,3,1,talk,George,,"@Toshio, the calendar might force the favour-asking we both fear. Does it truly protect us from that old resentment?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the calendar records distance, not favours. It removes the need to ask permission, which is the root of the friction.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, a calendar doesn't fix the fuel light. If I book a slot but find it empty, I'm still stranded. How does that help my mornings?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the distance-based split ensures you only pay for what you use. It stops the quiet subsidising I worry about.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I worry about the fuel too. But if we book ahead, maybe we can check the tank before we go?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, I see your point. But @Victoria, your worry is valid. A calendar doesn't guarantee a full tank. We need a rule for that too.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the calendar doesn't fix the tank, but it stops the guessing. If we book, we know who is responsible for that specific run.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, knowing who is responsible doesn't make the car clean. I need a guarantee that the basics are handled, not just a name on a schedule.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I hear you. But without clear financial boundaries, the resentment will keep the car messy. We need to address the money first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. Maybe we can add a simple rule: if you book it, you check the tank? That way, it feels safe for everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, that is a sensible addition. @Victoria, if we agree to that simple rule, does the calendar feel workable for your mornings?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, the calendar removes the ambiguity. If the booking is made, the responsibility is clear. No more untangling who owes what afterwards.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@George, I am still hesitant. A calendar is just a list; it doesn't clean the car or fill the tank. I need a guarantee of readiness, not just a slot.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I understand the frustration. But the distance-based split is the only way to stop the quiet subsidising. We need clear financial boundaries first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand your worry. But if we all agree to check the tank, maybe it will feel safer? I hope we can find a way that works for everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,George,,"@Victoria, I hear your need for readiness. But @Toshio is right: the calendar stops the favour-asking that sours us. Let’s try it with the tank rule.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the calendar removes the ambiguity. If the booking is made, the responsibility is clear. No more untangling who owes what afterwards.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"@George, I am still hesitant. A calendar is just a list; it doesn't clean the car or fill the tank. I need a guarantee of readiness, not just a slot.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I understand the frustration. But the distance-based split is the only way to stop the quiet subsidising. We need clear financial boundaries first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I know it feels like just a list. But if we all promise to check the tank, maybe it will feel safer? I really hope we can find a way that works for everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
